"<b>Kodak Tmax 400</b>:<p>Simulate the Kodak Tmax black and white film at 400 "
"ISO</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Kodak Tmax 400</b>:<p>Simula o filme branco e negro Kodak Tmax con 400 "
"ISO</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:289
msgid "Kodak TriX"
msgstr "Kodak TriX"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:290
msgid ""
"<b>Kodak TriX</b>:<p>Simulate the Kodak TriX black and white film at 400 "
"ISO</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Kodak TriX</b>:<p>Simula o filme branco e negro Kodak Tmax con 400 ISO</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:303
msgid "No Lens Filter"
msgstr "Sen filtro de lente"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:304
msgid ""
"<b>No Lens Filter</b>:<p>Do not apply a lens filter when rendering the image."
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Sen filtro de lente</b>:<p>Non aplica nengún filtro de lente para debuxar "
"a imaxe.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:308
msgid "Green Filter"
msgstr "Filtro verde"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:309
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Green Filter</b>:<p>Simulate black and white film "
"exposure using a green filter. This is useful for all scenic shoots, "
"especially portraits photographed against the sky.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con filtro verde</b>:<p>Simula a exposición dun filme de "
"branco e negro usando un filtro de verde. Isto é útil con calquera "
"escenario, especialmente para retratos tomados contra o ceo.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:315
msgid "Orange Filter"
msgstr "Filtros laranxa"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:316
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Orange Filter</b>:<p>Simulate black and white film "
"exposure using an orange filter. This will enhance landscapes, marine scenes "
"and aerial photography.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con filtro laranxa</b>:<p>Simula a exposición dun filme de "
"branco e negro usando un filtro de laranxa. Isto mellora as paisaxes, "
"escenas mariñas e fotografía aérea.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:322
msgid "Red Filter"
msgstr "Filtro vermello"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:323
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Red Filter</b>:<p>Simulate black and white film "
"exposure using a red filter. This creates dramatic sky effects, and "
"simulates moonlight scenes in the daytime.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con filtro vermello</b>:<p>Simula a exposición dun filme "
"de branco e negro usando un filtro de vermello. Isto dálle un efeito "
"dramático ao ceo e simula escenas con luz de lúa de día.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:329
msgid "Yellow Filter"
msgstr "Filtro amarelo"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:330
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Yellow Filter</b>:<p>Simulate black and white film "
"exposure using a yellow filter. This has the most natural tonal correction, "
"and improves contrast. Ideal for landscapes.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con filtro amarelo</b>:<p>Simula a exposición dun filme de "
"branco e negro usando un filtro de amarelo. Isto ten a correción tonal máis "
"natural, e mellora o contraste. Ideal para paisaxes.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:336
msgid "Strength:"
msgstr "Forza:"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:340
msgid "Here, set the strength adjustment of the lens filter."
msgstr "Axuste aquí a potencial do filtro da lente."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:349
msgid "No Tone Filter"
msgstr "Sen filtro de tons"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:350
msgid "<b>No Tone Filter</b>:<p>Do not apply a tone filter to the image.</p>"
msgstr "<b>Sen filtro de tons</b>:<p>Non aplica un filtro de tons á imaxe.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:354
msgid "Sepia Tone"
msgstr "Ton sepia"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:355
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Sepia Tone</b>:<p>Gives a warm highlight and mid-tone "
"while adding a bit of coolness to the shadows - very similar to the process "
"of bleaching a print and re-developing in a sepia toner.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton sepia</b>:<p>Dá un realzado cálido e de medios "
"tons á vez que engade un pouco de frio nas sombras, moi semellante ao "
"proceso de lixiviar un impreso e desenvolvela de novo nun toner sepia.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:361
msgid "Brown Tone"
msgstr "Ton marrón"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:362
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Brown Tone</b>:<p>This filter is more neutral than the "
"Sepia Tone filter.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton marrón</b>:<p>Este filtro é máis neutro que o "
"filtro de ton sepia.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:367
msgid "Cold Tone"
msgstr "Ton frío"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:368
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Cold Tone</b>:<p>Start subtly and replicate printing "
"on a cold tone black and white paper such as a bromide enlarging paper.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton frío</b>:<p>Fai unha réplica de impresión nun "
"papel de branco e negro con ton frío tal como papel de ampliación ao bromuro."
"</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:374
msgid "Selenium Tone"
msgstr "Tón de selenio"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:375
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Selenium Tone</b>:<p>This effect replicates "
"traditional selenium chemical toning done in the darkroom.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton de selenio</b>:<p>Este efeito replica o ton "
"tradicional de proceso químico ao selenio.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:380
msgid "Platinum Tone"
msgstr "Ton de platino"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:381
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Platinum Tone</b>:<p>This effect replicates "
"traditional platinum chemical toning done in the darkroom.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton de platino</b>:<p>Este efeito replica o ton "
"tradicional de proceso químico ao platino.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:386
msgid "Green Tone"
msgstr "Ton verde"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:387
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with greenish tint</b>:<p>This effect is also known as "
"Verdante.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Branco e negro con ton verde</b>:<p>Este filtro tamén é coñecido como "
"Verdante.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:432
msgid "Film"
msgstr "Filme"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:433
msgid "Lens Filters"
msgstr "Filtros de lente"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:434
msgid "Tone"
msgstr "Ton"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:435
msgid "Lightness"
msgstr "Brillo"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:766
msgid "Convert to Black && White"
msgstr "Converter a branco e negro"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:1001
msgid "Black & White Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Ficheiro de configuración de branco e negro a cargar"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:1014
