msgstr "Ficheiro de configuración de branco e negro onde gardar"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:1105
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Black & White text file."
msgstr "Non é posíbel gardar a configuración no ficheiro de branco e negro."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:79
msgid "Auto Correction"
msgstr "Correción automática"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Here you can see the auto-color correction tool preview. You can pick color "
"on image to see the color level corresponding on histogram."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode previsualizar a correción automática da cor. Pode extrair unha cor "
"da imaxe para ver o nível correspondente no histograma."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:111
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:281
msgid "Auto Levels"
msgstr "Níveis automáticos"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:112
msgid ""
"<b>Auto Levels</b>:<p>This option maximizes the tonal range in the Red, "
"Green, and Blue channels. It searches the image shadow and highlight limit "
"values and adjusts the Red, Green, and Blue channels to a full histogram "
"range.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Níveis automáticos</b>:<p>Esta opción maximiza o rango de tons nas canles "
"vermella, verde e azul. Procura os valores límite de sombra e luz da imaxe e "
"axusta as canles vermella, verde e azul para ter o rango completo do "
"histograma.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:120
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:285
msgid "Normalize"
msgstr "Normalizar"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<b>Normalize</b>:<p>This option scales brightness values across the active "
"image so that the darkest point becomes black, and the brightest point "
"becomes as bright as possible without altering its hue. This is often a "
"\"magic fix\" for images that are dim or washed out.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Normalizar</b>:<p>Esta opción escala os valores do brillo da imaxe de tal "
"maneira que o ponto máis escuro é convertido en negro, e o máis claro faise "
"tan brillante como se poda sen alterar o seu ton. Isto a miúdo é unha "
"«correción máxica» para imaxes escuras ou claras de máis.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:130
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:289
msgid "Equalize"
msgstr "Ecualizar"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:131
msgid ""
"<b>Equalize</b>:<p>This option adjusts the brightness of colors across the "
"active image so that the histogram for the value channel is as nearly as "
"possible flat, that is, so that each possible brightness value appears at "
"about the same number of pixels as each other value. Sometimes Equalize "
"works wonderfully at enhancing the contrasts in an image. Other times it "
"gives garbage. It is a very powerful operation, which can either work "
"miracles on an image or destroy it.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ecualizar</b>:<p>Esta opción axusta o brillo das cores da imaxe de tal "
"maneira que o histograma do canal de valor resulte o máis chao posíbel, isto "
"é, que cada posíbel valor de brillo apareza máis ou menos o mesmo número de "
"píxeles que o resto de valores. Ás veces Ecualizar funciona marabillosamente "
"para mellorar os contraste nunha imaxe. Outras veces xera lavaduras. É unha "
"operación moi poderosa, que pode ou facer milagres ou destruir unha imaxe.</"
"p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:143
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:293
msgid "Stretch Contrast"
msgstr "Maximizar o contraste"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:144
msgid ""
"<b>Stretch Contrast</b>:<p>This option enhances the contrast and brightness "
"of the RGB values of an image by stretching the lowest and highest values to "
"their fullest range, adjusting everything in between.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Maximizar o contraste</b>:<p>Esta opción mellora o contraste e brillo dos "
"valores RGB da imaxe levando os valores máximo e mínimo ao rango completo, "
"axustando todos os intermedios.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:152
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:297
msgid "Auto Exposure"
msgstr "Exposición automática"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:153
msgid ""
"<b>Auto Exposure</b>:<p>This option enhances the contrast and brightness of "
"the RGB values of an image to calculate optimal exposition and black level "
"using image histogram properties.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Exposición automática</b>:<p>Esta opción mellora o contraste e brillo dos "
"valores RGB da imaxe calculando a exposición óptima e o nível negro usando "
"as propriedades do histograma da imaxe.</p>"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageplugin_sheartool.cpp:51
msgid "Shear..."
msgstr "Inclinar..."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:73
#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:324
msgid "Shear Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de inclinación"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:77
msgid ""
"This is the shear operation preview. If you move the mouse cursor on this "
"preview, a vertical and horizontal dashed line will be drawn to guide you in "
"adjusting the shear correction. Release the left mouse button to freeze the "
"dashed line's position."
msgstr ""
"Esta é a vista previa da operación de inclinación da imaxe. Se move o cursor "
"do rato nesta vista previa debuxarase unha liña discontinua vertical e "
"horizontal para guialo no axuste da operación de inclinación. Prema no botón "
"primario do rato para fixar a posición das liñas discontínuas."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:109
msgid "Main horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal principal:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:114
msgid "The main horizontal shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "A ángulo de inclinación horizontal principal, en graus."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:116
msgid "Fine horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal fino:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:120
msgid ""
"This value in degrees will be added to main horizontal angle value to set "
"fine adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo horizontal principal para "
"permitir axustes finos."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:122
msgid "Main vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical principal:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:127
msgid "The main vertical shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "A ángulo de inclinación vertical principal, en graus."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:129
msgid "Fine vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical fino:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:133
msgid ""
"This value in degrees will be added to main vertical angle value to set fine "
"adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo vertical principal para permitir "
"axustes finos."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/sheartool.cpp:137
msgid ""
"Enable this option to apply the anti-aliasing filter to the sheared image. "
"To smooth the target image, it will be blurred a little."
msgstr ""
"Habilite esta opción para procesar un filtro de antialiasing (suavización) "
"na imaxe inclinada. Cando a suavice, a imaxe quedará lixeiramente difuminada."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:53
msgid "Inpainting..."
msgstr "Reparación de fotos..."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:55
msgid ""
"This filter can be used to inpaint a part in a photo. Select a region to "
"inpaint to use this option."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro pode ser usado para reparar unha parte dunha fotografía. Escolla "
"a rexión a reparar para usar esta opción."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:88
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de reparación de fotografías"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:89
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr "Necesita escoller unha rexión a reparar para usar esta ferramenta"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:90
msgid "Inpainting"
msgstr "Reparación de imaxes"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:95
msgid "Here you can see the image selection preview with inpainting applied."
msgstr "Aquí pode previsualizar a selección da imaxe coa reparación aplicada."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:124
msgctxt "no inpainting type"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengún"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:125
msgid "Remove Small Artifact"
msgstr "Eliminar os artefactos pequenos"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:126
msgid "Remove Medium Artifact"
msgstr "Eliminar os artefactos medios"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:127
msgid "Remove Large Artifact"
msgstr "Eliminar os artefactos grandes"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:128
msgid ""
"<p>Select the filter preset to use for photograph restoration here:</"
"p><p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default.<br/"
"><b>Remove Small Artifact</b>: inpaint small image artifact like image "
"glitch.<br/><b>Remove Medium Artifact</b>: inpaint medium image artefact.<br/"
"><b>Remove Large Artifact</b>: inpaint image artifact like unwanted object.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolla aquí os axustes do filtro a usar na restauración das fotografías:"
"</p><p><b>Nengún</b>: Os valores máis comúns. Coloca a configuración no "
"estado predefinido.<br/><b>Eliminar os artefactos pequenos</b>: pinta os "
"pequenos artefactos da imaxe, como os pequenos defeitos de imaxe.<br/"
"><b>Eliminar os artefactos medios</b>: pinta os artefactos medios de imaxe."
"<br/><b>Eliminar os artefactos grandes</b>: pinta os artefactos grandes, "
"como os obxectos indesexados.</p>"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:373
msgid "InPainting"
msgstr "Reparación de imaxes"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:380
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Ficheiro de configuración da reparación de fotos a cargar"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:391
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Inpainting settings text file."
msgstr "«%1» non é un ficheiro de configuración da reparación de fotografías."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/inpaintingtool.cpp:398
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr ""
